t;'-cced340fe4e4e4ecEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-a9872f1f8aca69baEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_GLO_Alchemy_LesserOilSharpness</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_GLO_Alchemy_LesserOilSharpness\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_GLO_Alchemy_LesserOilSharpness\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">b356d53e-d713-44a1-a5cf-a0262f998856</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:b356d53e-d713-44a1-a5cf-a0262f998856\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:b356d53e-d713-44a1-a5cf-a0262f998856\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n      <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Today I snapped at a good friend of mine in the <a href=\"/wiki/Elfsong_Tavern\" title=\"Elfsong Tavern\">Elfsong</a>. I'm embarrassed about it now. Not then. This prickly mood had come over me, because for the first time in ages I was thinking hard about my condition.\n</p><p><br>\nThe friction of cloth on my scaleless, malformed flesh has escalated into a sharp tug. Can't get that word out of my head. <i>shhhhhaaaaaarrrrp</i>.\n</p><p><br>\nEnded up scribbling a tried-and-tested oil formula, just to busy my throbbing hands. Reading it over, I grin, which hurts almost as much as writing. \n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><br>\nStir <a href=\"/wiki/Salts_of_Viridian_Crystal\" title=\"Salts of Viridian Crystal\">Salts of Viridian Crystal</a> into any Vitriol, and you will produce an oil good for putting on weapons, making their edge keener. The oil is called Lesser Oil of Sharpness.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><br>\nNever was good at naming <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">alchemical</a> products. Not exactly imaginative. Well, to hell with it.\n</p><p><br>\nHolding my hot chocolate, one of the few comforts I've got now, in the scratching, numbing, pinching, peeling, maddening ache of the everyday.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202306\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.060 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.063 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1952/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 37019/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12130/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.020/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936553/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   52.201      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   52.201      1 -total\n 41.14%   21.476      7 Template:Icon_text\n 41.14%   21.473      1 Template:PageSeo\n 41.00%   21.403      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 40.00%   20.880     23 Template:Trim\n 32.27%   16.846      1 Template:SmRarityItem\n 19.18%   10.014      1 Template:Item_icon\n 19.10%    9.968      2 Temp